11e9f2992015565cadb2949068bde4.mp4?t=1749422609\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Aerial combo</h2><br>After using the right button to chase the enemy, use the left button to attack the enemy in a smooth mid-air combo<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3070450/extras/49c37a1ad79def6261a3211b4ee8207a.avif?t=1749422609\" width=294 height=232 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Active Equipment Slot</h2><br>There are 2 active equipment slots. You need to press P to open the backpack and install the equipment into the corresponding slots. The initial keys are Q and E. In this game, you can obtain a large amount of equipment through exploration and challenges to enhance yourself. Use different equipment to match your own combat style. In addition, there are 2 passive equipment slots. Passive equipment can directly trigger attack effects through some key combinations",
